# Security Triage (Weekly)

## Cadence

- Run `bash scripts/check-security-triage.sh --wait-ci 300` weekly
- Triage Dependabot Critical/High first; open version-update PRs next

## Gates

- Zero open Critical/High Dependabot alerts before release (`pre-release-gate.sh`)
- Required workflows green: **Android CI**, **CodeQL**
- Scorecard / Trivy are optional — SKIP when workflows are absent (see `docs/SECURITY_TRIAGE.md`)

## gh auth

Dependabot API requires `gh` auth with access to repository security alerts. On Windows Git Bash, scripts use `scripts/lib/resolve-gh.sh` (`gh.exe`). See `docs/SECURITY_TRIAGE.md`.
